# vendored agent skills + hooks installed by `npx impeccable install` — tooling,
# not project code; the skill re-installs on demand. Scoped to the impeccable
# paths so the tracked supabase skills (.agents/skills/supabase*) and CI
# (.github/workflows/) are untouched.
.agents/skills/impeccable/
.codex/
.github/hooks/
.github/skills/

# playwright artifacts
test-results/
playwright-report/

# local working briefs — implementation specs handed to the agent, not project docs
docs/INSTRUCTIONS_NEXT_STEPS.md
